<title>USA: Nabors acquires California driller.</title>
<headline>Nabors acquires California driller.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nabors Industries inc said Thursday it has acquired privately owned Cleveland Drilling Co Inc for $11.7 million in cash.</p>
<p>The Cleveland fleet, based in Bakersfield, Calif., consists of seven active rigs.  The rigs are primarily rated for shallow and medium depth drilling, with four of the rigs rated at 10,000 feet or less and the other three rated between 12,000 and 18,000 feet.</p>
<p>Nabors said &quot;We are pleased that Ron Cleveland has agreed to join us as manager of Nabors' California district.&quot;</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
